(Test append value forms - plan 250 D2: the value slot used a restricted
 rule that rejected arithmetic and braced expressions)

a list called "s" is [].
a number called "i" is 2.

(Test 1: arithmetic expression value)
append i multiply i to s.

(Test 2: braced expression value - braces force the general parser)
append {i multiply i add 1} to s.

(Test 3: operator precedence matches the general expression parser)
append 1 add 2 multiply 3 to s.

(Test 4: literal and bare variable values still work)
append 7 to s.
append i to s.

For each n in s,
  print the n.
